{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/10/1149963/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"間違えたね！昨日のブログ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タンバリン来週だったみたい！！w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、\n来週も乃木中観てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/10/1149963/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『NOGIBINGO!7』が始まります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとちょっとだ！\nもうすぐ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/10/1149963/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7まで来ちゃうと\nすごいんだかなんだか\nよくわかんなくなってくる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...けど、やっぱりすごいよね！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/10/1149963/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初回から出てますので観てね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は今ちょっと眠たいから\n起きてられるか不安です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日発売の『MARQUEE』\n中田も載ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/10/1149963/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわたんの連載のコーナーに\n呼んでもらえたよ～！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このコーナー好きで今まで見てたから\n出れて嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/10/1149963/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装もセットも可愛くて可愛くて可愛い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしゃれに撮っていただきましたので\n要チェックです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/10/1149963/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちなみに撮影した日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんからの評判が良かった\nあの病み上がりのギタヒロ配信の付近ですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/10/1149963/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}